# screenshot scratch are not (build HTML + BRIEF.md source ARE committed).
scrollcraft/**/assets/
scrollcraft/**/out/
scrollcraft/**/shots/
scrollcraft/**/*.mp4
scrollcraft/**/*.png
scrollcraft/**/*.webm
scrollcraft/**/*.mov
.env
